            "review_title": "Review at Topaz Beer Club - Almaz",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nLacking atmosphere\nOct 2024 • Friends\nWell let's start with the name, which honestly sounds nothing like an Italian restaurant!\nWe went as a small group of friends on a Monday night and it was dead, the staff certainly outnumbered us.\nI ordered a daught Heineken to be told they only had Tuger on tap, which is fine but they could have been clearer that the cost was higher for that.\nI had a fairly average tomatoe chilli pasta, although others in the group raved about rhe risotto so clearly I chose wrong.\nThere was a nice bread basket to share while we waited for mains. Overall, it just feels like a overly large vacant space with not much atmosphere, but then it was a Monday night.\nRead more\nWritten October 8, 2024",
