            "review_title": "Review at Topaz Beer Club - Almaz",
            "review_text": "Vanessa F\nHanoi, Vietnam102 contributions\n1\nA few families together\nSep 2018 • Friends\nThe restaurant is quite large but very quiet as it is about 35 minutes away from Hanoi centre. \nThe restaurant has a couple of screens to show sports should the customers wish. There is also a movie room with big screen and bean bags ( the kids loved it), a pool 🎱 table and football table, so the kids and, indeed adults were busy whilst we waited for the food ( which was a long time). Service was extremely slow and the waiting staff appeared to be lost at times.\nThe food was very nice, there lots of different types of beer and they are accommodating to change ( if they understand what you want to change in English)).\nWorthy a visit.\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2018\nLinh Đ\nDear Ms Vanessa\nWe're glad that you have spent your time visiting us and we would like to express my sincerely thank for you compliment to our food & space. Indeed, the service may have occurred some unwanted problems causing to your unfulfillment experience. We're reviewing this and improving our service immediately\nWe hope to see you again at Almaz!\nRead more\nWritten September 10, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
