            "review_title": "Review at Topaz Beer Club - Almaz",
            "review_text": "trang v\nHanoi, Vietnam37 contributions\n1\nVery intimate restaurant\nJul 2018 • Business\nRather spacious restaurant but very quiet, only 2 of us during lunch time. Set menu for hotpot (grill & all) at reasonable price. Fresh food, courteous service quality, all very good & 5 stars except outside security guard, very rude, not helpful & look down customers. If you would like to have meal there, highly recommended to travel by car & wear luxury clothes, otherwise you will be looked down and treated very badly. Keep in mind, come as a business, not a traveller...so disappointed for that kind of service, although we pay all for food & drink inside :((((((((((\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 11, 2018\nLinh Đ\nDear Ms. Tracy Hanoi,\n\nOn behalf of Topaz Beer Club Restaurant and Almaz International Cuisine & Convention Center, we'd like to send you the sincerely apology for your uncompleted experience last time. In general, Almaz does not expect this experience to happen to any customers of us and we see your feedback as one of our imperfections. Therefore, we really appreciate your feedback and will forward this review accompany with a warning letter to our Security Department so that they can improve their welcome attitude.\nOnce again, we're so sorry for your inconvenience and look forward to your next visit!\nSincerely yours!\nRead more\nWritten July 12, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
